OL,3,AMore asbestos found in Parliament, as
OL,4,AMPs urged to get on with revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore asbestos has been discovered in
OL,7,FParliament, the BBC has learnt, as MPs
OL,8,Fcome under pressure to sign off on a
OL,9,Fmajor revamp of the crumbling home of
OL,10,FUK democracy.
OL,12,FKnown asbestos items in the Palace of
OL,13,FWestminster and wider parliamentary
OL,14,Festate, such as insulation, roofing,
OL,15,Ffloor tiles and ropes, now number more
OL,16,Fthan 1,650 - an increase of 500 since
OL,17,F2021.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
