OL,3,AMore asbestos found in Parliament, as
OL,4,AMPs urged to get on with revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as the government considers
OL,7,Fholding a vote on refurbishing
OL,8,FParliament, which could cost up to
OL,9,F#40bn and take 61 years, after years of
OL,10,Findecision and delay.
OL,12,FThe Commons public accounts committee
OL,13,Fthis week warned it was "crunch time"
OL,14,Ffor Parliament's restoration, with
OL,15,Fevery additional year of delay costing
OL,16,Ftaxpayers #420m.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
